 capital spending and net cash interest expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2021 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Storey","x":"With the abundance of streaming providers, the bundling of video is becoming less relevant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2021 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Storey","x":"The team is energized for rapid change as we streamline our assets and aggressively invest to drive growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2022 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Storey","x":"As you will hear from Chris, we are passing through the effects of the adjusted closing date but are making no other change to the outlook we provided last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2022 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Feldman","x":"And even yesterday, AT&T announced that they would start taking price on some legacy plans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2022 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"…within the waterfall chart in our earnings presentation, you should consider three main moving parts: investing in opex for growth, the synergies expected related to transactions and lower transformation cost savings expected in 2022 as we focus resources on separating the pending divestitures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/