2-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2023 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2023-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"That's more of a pruning exercise than any kind of a major restructuring of any kind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/02/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2023 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"In addition to restructuring the balance sheet, we've made the difficult decision to reshape and rightsize Lumen for growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/31/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2023 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"The way we offset that is the cost-reduction program that Kate announced today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/31/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2023 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2024-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"Whether it's hybrid or multi-cloud or edge compute or emerging technologies like GenAI, businesses need fiber networks with digital services that deliver blazing fast speeds, ultra-low latency, massive capacity for growing data workloads and proximity to widely distributed users.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2023 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2024-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Simon Flannery","x":"How should we think about some of the opex savings from some of the severance and other actions that you've recently been taking?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2024-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"Going forward, we expect to realize additional cost takeout opportunities as we further reshape our organizational structure, rationalize third-party spend, drive increased adoption of AI to automate manual processes, and shut down non-core legacy products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2024-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"Obviously, as we're driving penetration, we've got to make the trade-off between -- at what time do you raise prices, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2024-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"Additionally, we're continuing to reshape and rightsize our business through automation and AI, continuously redeploying resources to the highest impact growth priorities and taking cost out in the form of people and vendor spend reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2024-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"As planned last week, we took material cost-out actions as we continue to improve processes and shape-shift our organization to support our strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/lumen-technologies-lumn-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q2","e":"lumn","d":"2024-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"In contrast, the announcement we made last night about Lumen's pivot to growth is all about building critical infrastructure to support the AI economy for the next several decades.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q2","e":"lumn","d":"2024-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"The dramatic rise in AI innovation spring explosive growth in data center build-outs, and data centers simply have to be connected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q2","e":"lumn","d":"2024-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher David Stansbury","x":"In fact, we have raised prices where we see the opportunity to do so, and we'll continue to do that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q2","e":"lumn","d":"2024-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"Today, we're announcing that we see a path to creating $1 billion in cost takeout by the end of 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q2","e":"lumn","d":"2024-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"Once we unify the network and simplify the product portfolio in our enterprise business, we'll go after technical cost savings in IT.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/lumen-technologies-lumn-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2024-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"The market now recognizes that AI needs data, data needs data centers, and those data centers need to be connected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2024-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"In Phase 1, hyperscalers, social platforms, and cloud companies are massively expanding their networks to support data center buildup for their AI model training.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2024-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"We have a plan to take cost out, deleverage our balance sheet, and drive growth by using our assets and intellectual property to give enterprise customers new value in a multi-cloud hybrid architecture environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q3","e":"lumn","d":"2024-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"One, how we are continuing to drive operational efficiency with sales growth and higher customer sat in our core business to ensure we maximize cash generation, customer lifetime value, and cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2025-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"With a combination of improved revenue mix and cost takeout, we see Lumen returning to full year EBITDA growth in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2025-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher David Stansbury","x":"Additionally, with the progress we've made to date, we estimate our run rate cost savings exiting 2025 to be approximately $250 million, a strong start toward our $1 billion goal exiting 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"So, when a new global player in AI announces a disruptive breakthrough, we see that as a great thing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2024 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"So, in short, the disruption we saw in the market last week will likely make AI more accessible to companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/lumen-technologies-lumn-q4-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"LUMN 2025 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"We exceeded our increased target for cost reduction, ending the year at over $400 million in run-rate savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumen-lumn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LUMN 2025 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Johnson","x":"Exiting 2026, we're targeting another $300 million of cost out, totaling $700 million run rate savings which positions us to hit our three-year $1 billion cost out target as well as our expected EBITDA growth this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumen-lumn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LUMN 2025 Q4","e":"lumn","d":"2026-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Stansbury","x":"And that obviously increased our guide for next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumen-lumn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LUMN 2026 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kathleen Johnson","x":"They're trying to build an AI-driven future on infrastructure that simply wasn't designed to support it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lumen-lumn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LUMN 2026 Q1","e":"lumn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Christopher Stansbury","x":"We remain on track to meet our full year guidance, and we'll continue investing in our transformation to serve customers in a multi-cloud AI world